            <h1 class="ui-heading-tg29bz7-h" data-ui-id="heading-tg29bz7-h" data-ui-state="default">Build responsive Astro interfaces visually.</h1>
            <p class="ui-text-tg29bz7-i" data-ui-id="text-tg29bz7-i" data-ui-state="default">Qt Creator-style workflow, web-native layout rules, reusable components, responsive states, actions, assets and clean Astro output.</p>
            <div class="ui-row-tg29bz7-j" data-ui-id="row-tg29bz7-j" data-ui-state="default">
              <button class="ui-button-tg29bz7-l" data-ui-id="button-tg29bz7-l" data-ui-state="default" data-ui-actions="[{&quot;event&quot;:&quot;click&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;navigate&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;/docs&quot;,&quot;target&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;condition&quot;:&quot;&quot;}]" type="button">Open docs</button>
              <a class="ui-link-tg29bz7-m" data-ui-id="link-tg29bz7-m" data-ui-state="default" href="#features">See features</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <article class="ui-card-tg29bz7-n" data-ui-id="card-tg29bz7-n" data-ui-state="default">
            <h3 class="ui-heading-tg29bz7-o" data-ui-id="heading-tg29bz7-o" data-ui-state="default">Source-first output</h3>
            <p class="ui-text-tg29bz7-p" data-ui-id="text-tg29bz7-p" data-ui-state="default">Generated pages, components, layouts, CSS, assets and client actions stay readable and editable.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="ui-section-tg29bz7-q" data-ui-id="section-tg29bz7-q" data-ui-state="default" aria-label="Features">
      <div class="ui-container-tg29bz7-r" data-ui-id="container-tg29bz7-r" data-ui-state="default">
        <h2 class="ui-heading-tg29bz7-s" data-ui-id="heading-tg29bz7-s" data-ui-state="default">A full visual frontend IDE</h2>
        <div class="ui-spacer-tg29bz7-13" data-ui-id="spacer-tg29bz7-13" data-ui-state="default"></div>
