            <h3 class="ui-heading-tg29bz7-y" data-ui-id="heading-tg29bz7-y" data-ui-state="default">Reusable components</h3>
            <p class="ui-text-tg29bz7-z" data-ui-id="text-tg29bz7-z" data-ui-state="default">Create project components with slots and instance overrides.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ui-card-tg29bz7-10" data-ui-id="card-tg29bz7-10" data-ui-state="default">
            <h3 class="ui-heading-tg29bz7-11" data-ui-id="heading-tg29bz7-11" data-ui-state="default">Behavior</h3>
            <p class="ui-text-tg29bz7-12" data-ui-id="text-tg29bz7-12" data-ui-state="default">State variables, bindings and web-native signal/action connections.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="ui-componentInstance-tg29bz8-1m" data-ui-id="componentInstance-tg29bz8-1m" data-ui-state="default" data-ui-timeline="ui-animation-componentInstance-tg29bz8-1m" data-ui-timeline-duration="520" data-ui-animation-engine="css" data-ui-animation-trigger="hover">
      <InfoPanel title={"Reusable component"}>
      <p class="ui-text-tg29bz8-1n" data-ui-id="text-tg29bz8-1n" data-ui-state="default">This content is passed through the default Astro slot.</p>
      </InfoPanel>
    </div>
    <button class="ui-button-tg29bz9-1u" data-ui-id="button-tg29bz9-1u" data-ui-state="default" data-ui-timeline="ui-animation-button-tg29bz9-1u" data-ui-timeline-duration="420" data-ui-animation-engine="waapi" data-ui-animation-trigger="click" data-ui-animation-id="button-tg29bz9-1u" type="button">Animate with JavaScript</button>
  </main>
  <script>import '../scripts/ui-runtime.ts';</script>
